WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.545
Here we are on the set of The Changeling.

00:00:03.921 --> 00:00:07.299
This is Victor LaValle, the author of The Changeling.

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:12.012
And this is Kelly Marcel, the showrunner and creator of The
Changeling show.

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.349
Welcome to the Elk Hotel. This is the hotel of one of our
episodes.

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:20.730
Yes, it’s about a character named Lillian, Apollo’s mother, as she goes through her own night.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.857
It’s like a dark night of the soul.

00:00:22.857 --> 00:00:26.652
We’d love to show you around the lobby and the hotel.

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:28.195
In our show, we have Easter eggs.

00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:37.538
Here’s one, this sign is signed by management, Lester. Lester Cohen is the production designer, and he is the mastermind behind this amazing, amazing set.

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:38.122
Yes.

00:00:38.122 --> 00:00:44.795
And if we come over here, we will see another wonderful Easter egg which is this ship, which is called a Sloop.

00:00:44.795 --> 00:00:52.470
If you’ve read the book and are a fan of the book, then you
already know how important this will be.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:57.641
One other detail that we’ve been talking about today is how
much we love the wallpaper in this lobby.

00:00:57.641 --> 00:01:11.071
And actually as we go through the hotel, you’re gonna see that Lester has chosen very solid colors for each section because it’s a very dreamlike episode.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:15.618
Well why don’t you let us show you the rest of the hotel?

00:01:15.618 --> 00:01:16.118
Yeah.

00:01:16.118 --> 00:01:23.709
The other thing that’s interesting about the Elk Hotel is this whole episode is not in the book, this is something that came about from Kelly and I talking.

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:28.255
So, it’s not in the book, but really slides nicely into the world of our show.

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:32.259
But this hotel really existed, this is actually the color that the walls were.

00:01:33.761 --> 00:01:35.596
Very nightmarish.

00:01:37.765 --> 00:01:42.186
This is patient zero’s room, so Lester’s removed the two and the zero.

00:01:42.186 --> 00:01:45.564
When you watch the episode, this room will completely
transform.

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:57.409
This episode is about people who have found themselves feeling discarded or forgotten, and all of them help each other through the experience.

00:02:00.037 --> 00:02:07.336
As Lillian goes through this episode, she starts to remember
places and people from her life.

00:02:07.336 --> 00:02:10.923
And we get to see her memories, like this.

00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:16.887
This is one of Lillian’s memories.

00:02:16.887 --> 00:02:18.889
Not one of the great memories.

00:02:18.889 --> 00:02:20.307
No.

00:02:20.307 --> 00:02:26.605
You will see some graffiti and this table top will magically change

00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:28.983
by the end of this episode.

00:02:28.983 --> 00:02:33.946
And feature carvings that you’ve seen on the first page of Victor’s book.

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:36.615
Tell me your life’s voyage.

00:02:39.618 --> 00:02:41.495
And I will tell you who you are.

